type: software
title: "os-xgs-npu: Sophos XGS appliances back as open firewalls"
abstract: >-
  FreeBSD drivers and an OPNsense plugin that bring Sophos XGS appliances back as open
  firewalls: every front port, with connections and IPsec offloaded to the coprocessor.
  XGS 136 and XGS 3300.
